abstract: >-
  A reproducible Python pipeline for corpus-based collocation analysis and
  multilingual sentence-embedding comparison of the red concept in the
  Chinese, English, and Spanish versions of Red Sorghum. Copyrighted novel
  texts and sentence-level derivatives are not redistributed.
keywords:
